    {"page": 1, "start": 102, "end": 123, "top": 85.2, "left": 431.4, "lastX": 520.2, "baseline": 96.02, "inkLeft": 431.69, "text": "crates of vegetables "},
    {"page": 1, "start": 123, "end": 149, "top": 99.0, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 184.8, "baseline": 109.46, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "from the farms on the far "},
    {"page": 1, "start": 149, "end": 172, "top": 99.0, "left": 431.4, "lastX": 540.0, "baseline": 109.46, "inkLeft": 431.69, "text": "shore. Nobody on board "},
    {"page": 1, "start": 172, "end": 202, "top": 112.2, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 196.2, "baseline": 122.93, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "hurries; they read, drink tea "},
    {"page": 1, "start": 202, "end": 224, "top": 112.2, "left": 431.4, "lastX": 528.6, "baseline": 122.93, "inkLeft": 431.69, "text": "from flasks and watch "},
    {"page": 1, "start": 224, "end": 248, "top": 126.0, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 175.2, "baseline": 136.37, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "the herons stand in the "},
    {"page": 1, "start": 248, "end": 267, "top": 126.0, "left": 431.4, "lastX": 519.0, "baseline": 136.37, "inkLeft": 431.69, "text": "shallows. When the "},
    {"page": 1, "start": 267, "end": 294, "top": 139.2, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 188.4, "baseline": 149.81, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "ferry docks, a short queue "},
    {"page": 1, "start": 294, "end": 339, "top": 139.2, "left": 331.2, "lastX": 529.2, "baseline": 149.81, "inkLeft": 331.08, "text": "forms along the jetty and the deckhand coils "},
    {"page": 1, "start": 339, "end": 369, "top": 152.4, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 201.6, "baseline": 163.25, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "the rope with practised ease.\u000d"},
    {"page": 1, "start": 369, "end": 471, "top": 172.2, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 540.0, "baseline": 182.69, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "A well-made map leaves out far more than it shows. The cartographer decides which roads matter, which "},
    {"page": 1, "start": 471, "end": 576, "top": 185.4, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 526.8, "baseline": 196.13, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "rivers deserve a name and where a label may sit without hiding a village. Every choice trades detail for "},
    {"page": 1, "start": 576, "end": 678, "top": 199.2, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 522.6, "baseline": 209.35, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "clarity, and the reader trusts the result because the trades were made carefully and applied the same "},
    {"page": 1, "start": 678, "end": 706, "top": 212.4, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 197.4, "baseline": 222.79, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "way across the whole sheet.\u000d"},
    {"page": 1, "start": 706, "end": 816, "top": 231.6, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 539.4, "baseline": 242.23, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "In the workshop the lamps stay lit late. Shavings gather under the bench, a kettle ticks as it cools, and the "},
    {"page": 1, "start": 816, "end": 924, "top": 244.8, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 523.8, "baseline": 255.67, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "half-finished chair waits for its last joint. The maker steps back, squints along the rail and decides that "},
    {"page": 1, "start": 924, "end": 1027, "top": 258.6, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 527.4, "baseline": 269.11, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "tomorrow will do for the glue, since good work is not improved by being rushed past the point of care.\u000d"},
    {"page": 1, "start": 1027, "end": 1127, "top": 277.8, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 516.0, "baseline": 288.58, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "The morning ferry crosses the estuary twice before the tide turns, carrying commuters, bicycles and "},
    {"page": 1, "start": 1127, "end": 1232, "top": 291.0, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 538.2, "baseline": 302.02, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "crates of vegetables from the farms on the far shore. Nobody on board hurries; they read, drink tea from "},
    {"page": 1, "start": 1232, "end": 1335, "top": 304.8, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 532.8, "baseline": 315.46, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "flasks and watch the herons stand in the shallows. When the ferry docks, a short queue forms along the "},
    {"page": 1, "start": 1335, "end": 1394, "top": 318.0, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 329.4, "baseline": 328.9, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "jetty and the deckhand coils the rope with practised ease.\u000d"},
    {"page": 1, "start": 1394, "end": 1412, "top": 337.8, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 150.0, "baseline": 348.34, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "A well-made map "},
